{{Documentation/Header}}
A notice marking a page as archived and no longer maintained. It adapts its wording to the namespace it sits in, and files the page into a matching archive category — [[:Category:Archived Article]] in mainspace, or <code>Archived ''Namespace''</code> elsewhere.

On template pages it adds "Please refrain from using this template."

==Syntax==
{{T|Archived|block=1
|v1=width =
|v2=info =
}}

==Example==
<pre>{{Archived|info=Superseded by {{Tabber}}.}}</pre>

